  "body": "## Issue\nRefs #628 (umbrella of the UX survey)\nDirect-PR: maintainer's own framing doc, PO decisions of 2026-11-08\n\n## What and why\nUpdates `docs/ux/questionnaire/cadrage-construction.md`, the source of the survey's question IDs, with the PO's decisions after reviewing the survey preview:\n- new question `G1`, right after `O1` and before any proposal: \"Au quotidien, qu'est-ce qui vous agace ou vous fait perdre du temps dans l'app ?\" (short free text, 20 s); asked before the proposals so they do not steer the answers;\n- card `C08` \"Images nettes\" retired (the feature already exists); its ID is never reused; nine cards remain;\n- D3 revised: live statistics after 10 answers (was 20);\n- `L2` wording aligned with #667; time budget now 6 min 40 s on iPad and 4 min 40 s on iPhone, under the limits.\n\nThe lots #629 (#667) and #633 (#668) apply the same decisions.\n\n## How it was verified\n- `markdownlint-cli2@0.18.1` with the repository config: 0 errors.\n\n## Checklist (AGENTS.md §9)\n- [x] Module boundaries respected (docs only)\n- [x] Tests added/updated: not applicable, docs only\n- [x] No secrets; fixtures anonymized\n- [x] Docs updated\n- [x] Author model: Opus 5.5 / Reviewer: the PO\n- [x] Fixes or changes a legacy-app behaviour? No\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n<!-- coderabbit-ai-generated:v1 -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **Documentation**\n  * Added an open-ended question about pain points and clarified its placement before the suggestions.\n  * Updated a question about what matters most when reading a topic.\n  * Removed one idea card and updated the displayed card count to nine.\n  * Clarified that card order is randomized for each respondent.\n  * Updated the estimated questionnaire durations and lowered the response threshold for displaying statistics.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->",
